357
00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:16.100
We all cried together, trying
to make sense of what we heard.

358
00:19:16.810 --> 00:19:19.170
But we never lost
our faith in you!

359
00:19:26.150 --> 00:19:28.970
This is a tale
from over a month ago.

360
00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:30.920
Nobles from all over the world

361
00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:33.200
gathered in the Holy Land
of Mary Geoise

362
00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:35.560
for a council known
as the Reverie.

363
00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:39.410
This is
an emergency!

364
00:19:39.450 --> 00:19:42.010
Intruders have infiltrated
the Land of the Gods!

365
00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:44.550
All citizens evacuate
immediately!

366
00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:47.610
The food
warehouse exploded!

367
00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:49.530
Do something,
you imbeciles!

368
00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:51.020
Our lives are in danger!

369
00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:53.280
Four
Revolutionary Army captains

370
00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:55.490
have been identified
on the premises!

371
00:19:56.730 --> 00:19:57.750
Those bastards!

372
00:19:58.720 --> 00:20:01.370
Burning down our symbol is
surely a crime worthy of death,

373
00:20:01.450 --> 00:20:04.430
but burning our food
adds insult to injury!

374
00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:07.040
They're jealous of us
because they're all poor!

375
00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:09.470
When we catch those
rats, heads will roll!

376
00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:12.780
You guards will pay
dearly for letting this happen!

377
00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:15.340
Your incompetence
will be the death of you!

378
00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:17.600
We will have all of your heads!

379
00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:26.310
I told you to hurry up!
Move! You lazy mongrel!

380
00:20:28.430 --> 00:20:32.460
Are you really going
to let me burn to death?

381
00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:34.190
Move faster this instant!

382
00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.410
That hurt!

383
00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:48.700
I can't believe you're
going to make me walk!

384
00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:51.160
You're not worth
the air you breathe!

385
00:20:53.070 --> 00:20:55.060
You've been terminated.

386
00:20:56.740 --> 00:20:58.350
Filthy beast.

387
00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:07.920
My gun!

388
00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:12.270
Who in blazes are you?

389
00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:14.140
That's a human life!

390
00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:19.440
Does that mean nothing
to you? Karasoot!

391
00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:25.720
Run
to the east side of town.

392
00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:29.070
Huh? I will, thank you!

393
00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:30.990
Please hurry, Saint Pluming!

394
00:21:31.150 --> 00:21:32.940
You need to evacuate
immediately!

395
00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:36.170
Damn you, Cipher Pol!
Where were you?

396
00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:39.010
Stop your dallying
and exterminate that vermin!

397
00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:42.340
A Revolutionary! Shoot him!

398
00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:49.990
Got him!
Just keep firing!

399
00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:51.780
Don't stop till you're
sure he's dead!

400
00:21:51.780 --> 00:21:55.660
Turn that feathered
terrorist to ash!

401
00:21:56.920 --> 00:22:00.000
Uh. Wait, everyone,
hold your fire!

402
00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:01.800
What happened to his body?

403
00:22:01.920 --> 00:22:05.760
We killed him, didn't we?
So where the hell is he?

404
00:22:12.710 --> 00:22:14.090
Ah, well that sucks.

405
00:22:31.880 --> 00:22:33.670
Run, trash.

406
00:22:34.210 --> 00:22:36.880
<b>Commander Karasu
(Soot-Soot Fruit)
Northern Forces
Revolutionary Army</b>

407
00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:47.140
Someone
help me already!

408
00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:54.740
Please help!
Let us escape, too!

409
00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:57.300
We'll die if we stay
chained like this!

410
00:22:57.380 --> 00:22:59.910
Don't leave us!

411
00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:01.400
Well, hello!

412
00:23:04.010 --> 00:23:06.930
I'll get those chains
for you! Hang tight!

413
00:23:07.840 --> 00:23:09.200
What's happening?

414
00:23:10.660 --> 00:23:14.620
Nobody move,
okay? Here goes!

415
00:23:14.900 --> 00:23:18.100
Laser Shooter!

416
00:23:28.510 --> 00:23:31.680
Now run! Wait
at the east side of town!

417
00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:34.640
We'll get outta
this place together!

418
00:23:36.570 --> 00:23:39.990
– Thank you so much, sir!
– We owe you all of our lives!

419
00:23:39.990 --> 00:23:44.490
You guys can thank me
later! Just run for now!

420
00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:50.800
Ohh. That's a big one, huh?

421
00:23:51.410 --> 00:23:54.040
<b>Commander Lindbergh
Southern Forces
Revolutionary Army</b>

422
00:23:54.130 --> 00:23:57.260
Lindbergh!
We've got enemies incoming!

423
00:23:57.260 --> 00:23:58.380
Huh?

424
00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:00.370
Hurry up
and free the slaves!

425
00:24:00.450 --> 00:24:01.360
No problema!

426
00:24:05.480 --> 00:24:09.360
Something is headed this way.
Something strong!

427
00:24:11.750 --> 00:24:14.170
Crow.

428
00:24:15.670 --> 00:24:18.220
Soul Lotus!

429
00:24:48.840 --> 00:24:50.220
Get back here!

430
00:24:50.710 --> 00:24:53.970
How dare you repulsive
slaves defy my orders!

431
00:24:54.090 --> 00:24:56.260
The ground, it moved!

432
00:25:01.990 --> 00:25:05.620
Agh! What is
the meaning of this?

433
00:25:05.620 --> 00:25:08.660
Oopsie. Did I make
you trip and fall?

434
00:25:08.660 --> 00:25:10.360
A Giant!

435
00:25:13.710 --> 00:25:15.560
I'll be taking that.

436
00:25:15.640 --> 00:25:19.100
You'll never point this nasty
thing at people again!

437
00:25:19.470 --> 00:25:22.430
Yoohoo, boys!
Time to get shakin'!

438
00:25:22.520 --> 00:25:24.250
Go to the east side of town!

439
00:25:24.330 --> 00:25:26.800
My little friends
will be expecting you!

440
00:25:27.460 --> 00:25:30.130
<b>Commander Morley
Western Forces
Revolutionary Army</b>

441
00:25:30.130 --> 00:25:32.300
Go!
And be careful!

442
00:25:32.810 --> 00:25:33.620
Thank you!

443
00:25:36.420 --> 00:25:38.130
Hm?

444
00:25:38.480 --> 00:25:41.570
You
Revolutionaries really piss me off.

445
00:25:48.470 --> 00:25:51.570
You know what it means
to attack the Celestial Dragons,

446
00:25:51.650 --> 00:25:54.960
the punishment
for your crimes is death!

447
00:26:06.290 --> 00:26:11.040
Got a temper, don'tcha, tree?
Are you all bark and no bite?

448
00:26:11.040 --> 00:26:15.090
Shut your mouth, freak! Why
are you destroying the town?

449
00:26:15.280 --> 00:26:17.470
And where the hell
is your commander?

450
00:26:17.600 --> 00:26:20.560
Bringing in a third
on our date? Really?

451
00:26:20.600 --> 00:26:22.020
You pervert!

452
00:26:22.020 --> 00:26:22.930
Oh, hell no!

453
00:26:22.930 --> 00:26:27.070
I'm not taking that from you!
Look at what you're wearing!

454
00:26:28.410 --> 00:26:31.800
What, are
you checking me out?

455
00:26:33.360 --> 00:26:37.150
My goodness! You're really
ogling me, aren't you?

456
00:26:37.280 --> 00:26:40.700
If you like me that
much, just say so!

457
00:26:44.990 --> 00:26:47.010
Time to die!

458
00:26:51.030 --> 00:26:54.660
You! Ryokugyu!

459
00:26:55.050 --> 00:26:56.220
Now, see here!

460
00:26:56.260 --> 00:27:00.180
If we're hurt, I'll have
your head! That's a promise!

461
00:27:00.230 --> 00:27:02.210
Then get
your asses out of the way!

462
00:27:02.290 --> 00:27:03.440
I'm fighting here!

463
00:27:09.340 --> 00:27:11.930
Huh? Hey, Fujitora!

464
00:27:12.090 --> 00:27:14.380
What the hell are you
doing down there?

465
00:27:14.610 --> 00:27:17.370
Ending this.
I'm calling a meteor.

466
00:27:17.440 --> 00:27:21.400
Are you out
of your mind? Stop that!

467
00:27:21.580 --> 00:27:22.720
Two admirals.

468
00:27:22.900 --> 00:27:24.480
If this wasn't
the Land of the Gods,

469
00:27:24.590 --> 00:27:27.470
they woulda turned
this place to dust.

470
00:27:27.600 --> 00:27:29.540
They're still making
quite the mess.

471
00:27:29.860 --> 00:27:31.570
The rebels
aren't backing down,

472
00:27:31.570 --> 00:27:33.860
even though they're
at a disadvantage.

473
00:27:33.860 --> 00:27:35.820
If they have
that much confidence,

474
00:27:35.820 --> 00:27:38.220
their captains must
be terribly fearsome!

475
00:27:38.220 --> 00:27:41.220
Terribly! Yoyoi!

476
00:27:41.220 --> 00:27:42.840
Fine, then.

477
00:27:43.030 --> 00:27:47.530
We'll let the admirals handle
things. Let's move out.

478
00:28:00.390 --> 00:28:03.590
Sabo! Have you
found the keys to the collars?

479
00:28:03.590 --> 00:28:07.640
I know where they are at least.
I should have them soon.

480
00:28:08.940 --> 00:28:09.690
Hey, Lindbergh!

481
00:28:09.780 --> 00:28:11.570
That you,
Sabo? What is it?

482
00:28:11.600 --> 00:28:13.860
Kuma was heading off
to Pangaea Castle!

483
00:28:13.860 --> 00:28:16.400
What?
You mean on his own?

484
00:28:16.400 --> 00:28:20.110
I saw him with Saint Rosward
and his son Charlos.

485
00:28:19.890 --> 00:28:22.760
<b>Chief of Staff Sabo
Revolutionary Army</b>

486
00:28:22.600 --> 00:28:24.680
I think they're on their way
to finish what they started

487
00:28:24.680 --> 00:28:26.430
in the Mingling Courtyard.

488
00:28:27.120 --> 00:28:27.950
Wait, what?

489
00:28:30.870 --> 00:28:32.560
You're going
to be my new pet!

490
00:28:32.640 --> 00:28:34.460
Just you wait, my dear!

491
00:28:34.870 --> 00:28:37.090
That means Princess
Shirahoshi is in danger.

492
00:28:37.270 --> 00:28:38.560
How
dare they make Kuma

493
00:28:38.560 --> 00:28:40.760
do their dirty work for them!

494
00:28:40.760 --> 00:28:43.480
Don't worry. I'm not gonna
let them use him.

495
00:28:43.480 --> 00:28:45.380
Hey, Morley, get ready!

496
00:28:45.380 --> 00:28:47.060
Okey-dokey!

497
00:28:47.310 --> 00:28:50.530
We'll save Kuma.
No matter what the cost!

498
00:28:54.840 --> 00:28:56.070
Hold on, Dad!

499
00:29:09.850 --> 00:29:11.620
Please return to your room.

500
00:29:11.700 --> 00:29:13.120
Will you leave me alone?

501
00:29:13.580 --> 00:29:16.610
If you must know,
I'm going to ask Garp for help.

502
00:29:16.690 --> 00:29:19.110
We will provide all
the protection you need.

503
00:29:19.110 --> 00:29:22.750
Oh, will you, now? Like
you did for Shirahoshi?

504
00:29:22.750 --> 00:29:26.630
You let that happen.
That is on you.

505
00:29:26.730 --> 00:29:29.740
They'll come after her again,
and you know it!

506
00:29:35.540 --> 00:29:36.760
Your Majesty!

507
00:29:37.310 --> 00:29:38.960
Please, don't push yourself.

508
00:29:39.390 --> 00:29:42.410
I finally have a chance
to meet the Five Elders.

509
00:29:42.900 --> 00:29:44.990
It may very well be my last.

510
00:29:49.950 --> 00:29:50.800
Halt!

511
00:29:50.860 --> 00:29:54.820
Only King Cobra is permitted
an audience with the Five Elders.

512
00:29:54.880 --> 00:29:55.730
What?!

513
00:29:55.810 --> 00:29:57.230
Step back, you two.

514
00:29:59.100 --> 00:30:00.710
I won't be long,

515
00:30:00.710 --> 00:30:03.770
but I imagine it would be
quite dull to wait here.

516
00:30:04.030 --> 00:30:06.210
Why don't you look
after Vivi for me?

517
00:30:06.620 --> 00:30:08.390
She still gets up to mischief.

518
00:30:09.000 --> 00:30:10.950
I can't help
but worry about her.
